@startuml 01_architettura
!include style.iuml
title Architettura: chi usa cosa
left to right direction

actor Utente
file "modello 3D\n(.glb)" as glb
node "client.exe\n(viewer)" as client
node "engine.dll\n(motore grafico)" as engine
component "GLM\n(vettori e matrici,\nparte dell'API)" as GLM
rectangle "nascoste dentro il motore" {
  component OpenGL
  component FreeGLUT
  component Assimp
}

Utente --> client : tastiera, mouse
client --> engine : API Eng::
client ..> GLM
glb --> engine : Loader
engine --> OpenGL
engine --> FreeGLUT
engine --> Assimp
engine ..> GLM
@enduml
